<title>USA: Omaha hogs $1.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $1.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.50</p>
<p>lower. Top $54.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US  1-3    220-260 lbs    53.50-54.00</p>
<p>US  2-3    260-280 lbs    52.50-53.00</p>
<p>Sows: 25 percent. 1.00-4.00 lower. Top 47.00</p>
<p>US 1-3     350-500 lbs    45.00-45.50</p>
<p>US 2-3     500-650 lbs	    47.00</p>
</text>
